{"text": "North Richmond Street, being a dead end, was a quiet street except at the hour when the Christian Brothers School set the boys free. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At the blind end stood an uninhabited house of two storeys, detached from its neighbours on a square ground. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The other houses of the street, conscious of decent lives within them, gazed at one another with brown, imperturbable faces. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The former tenant of our house, a priest, had died in the back drawing room, and the air, musty from having been long enclosed, hung in all the rooms. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Among the useless papers in the waste room behind the kitchen, I found a few old books whose pages were curled and damp. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He had been a very charitable priest, for in his will he had left all his money to institutions and the furniture of his house to his sister. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When the short days of winter came, dusk fell before we had well eaten our dinners, and we played in the dark, muddy lanes behind the houses. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If Mangans sister came out on the doorstep to call her brother in to his tea, we watched her from our shadow peering up and down the street.", "alignment": {"characters": ["N", "o", "r", "t", "h", " ", "R", "i", "c", "h", "m", "o", "n", "d", " ", "S", "t", "r", "e", "e", "t", ",", " ", "b", "e", "i", "n", "g", " ", "a", " ", "d", "e", "a", "d", " ", "e", "n", "d", ",", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "q", "u", "i", "e", "t", " ", "s", "t", "r", "e", "e", "t", " ", "e", "x", "c", "e", "p", "t", " ", "a", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "h", "o", "u", "r", " ", "w", "h", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "C", "h", "r", "i", "s", "t", "i", "a", "n", " ", "B", "r", "o", "t", "h", "e", "r", "s", " ", "S", "c", "h", "o", "o", "l", " ", "s", "e", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "o", "y", "s", " ", "f", "r", "e", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\